314	   314	// ensureManagedPlugin / releaseManagedPlugin: the only writer of CyrusServerManagedPlugin. Server only.
315	   315	// Each call: (1) a short transaction locks the server's row (FOR UPDATE), plans with ./refs and records intent;
316	   316	// (2) the injected installer runs OUTSIDE any transaction (it talks to the server); (3) a second transaction
